an ominous radio station that transmits number sequences with mysterious messages. told is the expeditionâs story through an area bearing names such as 'path of the invisible hand', 'stalin highlands' or 'post-modernist cave labyrinth'.\nthe characters â student, entrepreneur, skilled worker â lose their life or at least get lost under unpleasant circumstances...\n\nhistory exhaustion is the audio transformation of an installation francis hunger created in 2009, focussing on the subject of 'verausgabung' (exhaustion).\n\nwith the voice of richard cotter.\nfrancis hunger\nis an artist, writer and curator. he lives in leipzig, germany.\n\nfind out more about francis hunger and his work at www.irmielin.org\nfurther information on the installation work 'history exhaustion' can be found at\nwww.irmielin.org/works/history_exhaustion/index.htm\nand at\nwww.metro-berlin.net/index.php/francis-hunger-history-exhaustion-press-release\n\nmetadata:\nhistory exhaustion\nby francis hunger\nproduction: miss.gunst / GUNST + radiator x\ndate: june 2010\nstation: radio x, frankfurt am main (germany)\nlength: 28 min.\nlicence: cc-by-nc-nd\nhttp://www.gunst.info","subject":"radio art;Radia;radio x","licenseurl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/","publicdate":"2010-09-16 20:01:36","addeddate":"2010-09-16 19:59:52","uploader":"radia.fm@gmail.com","updatedate":"2010-09-16 20:02:17","updater":"Radia.fm","boxid":"OL100020612","backup_location":"ia903606_14","date":"2010-06-21","radiaseason":"23","creator":"radio x","external_metadata_update":"2019-03-13T02:51:37Z"},"server":"ia600204.us.archive.org","uniq":385399761,"workable_servers":["ia600204.us.archive.org","ia800204.us.archive.org"]}